"""
=====================================================================
  SHOPORA — A full E-Commerce web application written entirely in
  Python (Flask + sqlite3). No separate .html/.css/.js files.
  All markup, styling and animation live inside this one script.
=====================================================================

FEATURES
  - Buyer signup (name, email, password, phone, full address)
  - Seller signup (name, email, password, business category,
    shop address, GSTN number for business verification)
  - Product listing with images, price, description, category
  - Star rating system + comments (reviews) per product
  - Add to Cart + dedicated Cart page
  - "Buy Now" -> Payment page -> Order confirmation
  - Seller Dashboard: add/manage own products, see own orders
  - Owner/Admin Dashboard: fixed admin email, sees every buyer,
    every seller and every order placed on the platform
  - Custom colour palette (Navy / Gold / Teal) + CSS animations

HOW TO RUN
  1) pip install flask
  2) python app.py
  3) open http://127.0.0.1:5000

ADMIN LOGIN (owner-only account, seeded automatically)
  email    : owner@shopora.admin
  password : Owner@123     (change ADMIN_PASSWORD below before deploy)
=====================================================================
"""

